<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (This project demonstrates that a conversational interface can be layered cleanly on top of a conventional, well- architected e-commerce backend rather than being built as an isolated demo. The TensorFlow intent classifier, while limited by dataset size as documented above, successfully routes 47 distinct intent types through a shared service layer that also powers a full REST API and two independent frontends. The explicit documentation of the classifier's limitations, and the concrete, architecture-compatible upgrade paths identified in Section 13, are presented as part of the project's engineering contribution rather than as unaddressed shortcomings.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
